Third-party components, under their own licences:

* `02_features/fe3_mjnet/` is a PyTorch reimplementation derived from mJ-Net
  (Tomasetti et al., Biomedical Data Analysis Laboratory, University of
  Stavanger), https://github.com/Biomedical-Data-Analysis-Laboratory/mJ-Net
* `02_features/fe4_nnunet/` builds on nnU-Net v2 (Isensee et al.),
  https://github.com/MIC-DKFZ/nnUNet - Apache-2.0
* `01_preprocessing/` uses SynthStrip and SynthSeg (FreeSurfer) as external
  tools.
